{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friend have been playing Hanafuda games late into the night, enjoying flavorful sake. He fell asleep, but you wanted to drink more. You head to the night market to buy additional sake, only to encounter a mystic ghost in a mirror who demands that you enter the Iron Maiden if you wish to survive until morning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598930/extras/Kittens_Cut.png?t=1745463233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survival Manual (a.k.a. Game Features)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torture yourself to reveal the locations of mystic chests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find chests containing Hanafuda Cards to collect points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid monsters that have more points than you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive until morning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not trust anyone!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598930?t=1745463233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598930?t=1745463233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598930/5dfadb536090d5696cf80d914dde904eba933dc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745463233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598930/5dfadb536090d5696cf80d914dde904eba933dc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745463233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes visual effects with a moderate amount of blood splashes during puzzle challenges."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friend have been playi